WEBVTT

00:00:00.592 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.166 --> 00:00:03.150
Does your salon have its own website yet?

00:00:03.353 --> 00:00:08.368
With VaraaAi, you get a beautiful website right away, with your services, team,

00:00:08.318 --> 00:00:10.190
reviews and a booking button,

00:00:10.455 --> 00:00:11.710
and you don't need to hire anyone.

00:00:12.305 --> 00:00:13.631
Tap Landing page.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.951
First, choose your Website colours:

00:00:15.987 --> 00:00:20.591
Rose, Champagne, Black and Gold, Emerald, or Lavender.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:24.511
Tap a colour set, and the whole website changes colour at once.

00:00:25.107 --> 00:00:26.437
Scroll down to Hero:

00:00:26.607 --> 00:00:28.437
the first impression for your customers.

00:00:28.704 --> 00:00:33.077
Choose a layout, then fill in the small line, the title, and a short text.

00:00:33.426 --> 00:00:37.397
Add up to five slider photos, set the button label, and tap Save.

00:00:37.999 --> 00:00:40.361
Below are the other parts of your home page:

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:46.521
About, Signature services, Highlights, Gallery, Team, and Customer reviews.

00:00:46.941 --> 00:00:49.721
Switch each one on or off with the toggle on the right.

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:54.121
Parts marked Automatic use your salon's data, so you don't type anything again.

00:00:54.715 --> 00:00:57.165
When you're done, tap View website to check it.

00:00:57.329 --> 00:00:58.125
Happy with it?

00:00:58.153 --> 00:01:01.085
Switch on Publish, and your salon's website is live.

00:01:01.356 --> 00:01:05.388
Tap Copy link to send it to customers, or add it to Facebook,

00:01:05.338 --> 00:01:07.085
Instagram and Google Maps.

00:01:07.733 --> 00:01:09.648
And here's the website your customers see:

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:14.570
your salon's name, your introduction, your menu with prices, your team,

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:17.888
your reviews, and a Book now button always in view.

00:01:18.217 --> 00:01:19.488
Now take the quiz below.
